'pagemanager_helpblurb' => "You can use the Page Manager to create web pages for your site.  You can create directories to organize your pages (and the folder names will be used in the URL, if you use friendly URLs), you can delete, edit and move pages, and you can create
		CSS and javascript files using the page manager.  Use the filter box to find your pages quickly, and the checkboxes to move or delete multiple pages and folders at once.  To view the page, click the green arrow next to the page name.<br /><br />
		When you make changes to a page, the previous version is stored as a revision.  You can click the menu next to a page and choose &quot;Manage Revisions&quot; to see these older versions, edit them, compare them to the current version of the page, and even
		restore the older version if necessary.",
